{"title": "个人页恒回源，其余路径照常缓存", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si http://localhost/profile/ | grep -E '^HTTP|X-Proxy-Cache'"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: BYPASS"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "bypass 1 恒真：重复请求依旧 BYPASS，每次回源"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si 'http://localhost/?no_cache=1' | grep X-Proxy-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: BYPASS"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "查询参数命中 $arg_no_cache，同样绕过"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si http://localhost/ | grep X-Proxy-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: HIT"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
